00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.279
It might be the oldest profession,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.169
but prostitution and other forms

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.119
of sex work are also among the most

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.429
prohibited and heavily regulated

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.869
around the world.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.729
At the latest Reason Speakeasy,

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.499
a monthly live event in New York

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.359
City with outspoken defenders of

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.219
