00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.959
I talked with Kaytlin Bailey, the

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.939
founder and head of Old Pros,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.829
a sex worker rights group, and

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.549
the writer and performer of Whore's

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.609
