00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.459
sexual freedom.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.319
Bailey and Old Pros seek not just to

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.239
decriminalize sex work, but

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.339
to destigmatize it, too,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.229
arguing that sex workers across

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.419
the centuries have not only provided

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.399
a much in-demand service but

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.139
helped to push the boundaries of

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.460
freedom and liberty.

00:00:54.899 --> 00:00:55.679
Kaytlin, thanks for joining us.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.999
